#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:4
msgid "Plugin DNS Providers"
msgstr "Plugin-DNS-Provider"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports a plugin-based DNS provider framework that allows "
"extending DNS management capabilities beyond the built-in providers. DNS "
"plugins implement a standard interface enabling |morpheus| to manage DNS "
"zones and records through custom or third-party DNS services."
msgstr "|morpheus| unterstützt ein pluginbasiertes DNS-Provider-Framework, mit dem DNS-Verwaltungsfunktionen über die integrierten Provider hinaus erweitert werden können. DNS-Plugins implementieren eine Standardschnittstelle, mit der |morpheus| DNS-Zonen und -Records über benutzerdefinierte oder Drittanbieter-DNS-Dienste verwalten kann."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:11
msgid ""
"Plugin DNS providers appear alongside built-in providers when configuring"
" DNS integrations and can be used anywhere DNS management is invoked, "
"including:"
msgstr "Plugin-DNS-Provider erscheinen neben integrierten Providern bei der Konfiguration von DNS-Integrationen und können überall verwendet werden, wo DNS-Verwaltung aufgerufen wird, einschließlich:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:13
msgid "Automatic DNS record creation during Instance provisioning"
msgstr "Automatische DNS-Record-Erstellung während der Instanz-Provisionierung"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:14
msgid "Manual DNS record management through the Domains interface"
msgstr "Manuelle DNS-Record-Verwaltung über die Domains-Oberfläche"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:15
msgid "DNS record cleanup during Instance teardown"
msgstr "DNS-Record-Bereinigung während des Instanz-Tear-downs"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:16
msgid "Integration with naming policies for automated DNS naming"
msgstr "Integration mit Naming-Policies für automatisierte DNS-Benennung"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:19
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architektur"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:21
msgid "The plugin DNS framework is built on the |morpheus| Plugin API:"
msgstr "Das Plugin-DNS-Framework basiert auf der |morpheus| Plugin API:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:23
msgid "Plugins implement the ``DnsProvider`` interface"
msgstr "Plugins implementieren die Schnittstelle ``DnsProvider``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:24
msgid "Each plugin registers one or more DNS provider types"
msgstr "Jedes Plugin registriert einen oder mehrere DNS-Provider-Typen"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:25
msgid "Providers handle zone and record CRUD operations"
msgstr "Provider handhaben CRUD-Operationen für Zonen und Records"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:26
msgid "|morpheus| manages the lifecycle and invocation of plugin operations"
msgstr "|morpheus| verwaltet den Lebenszyklus und den Aufruf von Plugin-Operationen"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:28
msgid ""
"Available plugin DNS providers are determined by which plugins are "
"installed on the |morpheus| appliance (Administration > Integrations > "
"Plugins)."
msgstr "Verfügbare Plugin-DNS-Provider werden durch die auf der |morpheus|-Appliance installierten Plugins bestimmt (Administration > Integrations > Plugins)."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:31
msgid "Configuring a Plugin DNS Provider"
msgstr "Plugin-DNS-Provider konfigurieren"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:33
msgid "To add a plugin-based DNS integration:"
msgstr "So fügen Sie eine pluginbasierte DNS-Integration hinzu:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:35
msgid "Ensure the DNS plugin is installed (|AdmIntPlu|)"
msgstr "Stellen Sie sicher, dass das DNS-Plugin installiert ist (|AdmIntPlu|)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:36
msgid "Navigate to |InfNetSer| (Infrastructure > Network > Services)"
msgstr "Navigieren Sie zu |InfNetSer| (Infrastructure > Network > Services)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:37
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Klicken Sie auf :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:38
msgid "Select the plugin DNS provider type from the dropdown"
msgstr "Wählen Sie den Plugin-DNS-Provider-Typ aus dem Dropdown-Menü"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:39
msgid "Complete the provider-specific configuration fields:"
msgstr "Füllen Sie die providerspezifischen Konfigurationsfelder aus:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:41
msgid "**NAME:** Descriptive name for the DNS integration"
msgstr "**NAME:** Beschreibender Name für die DNS-Integration"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Additional fields vary by plugin** (e.g., API URL, credentials, zone "
"filters)"
msgstr "**Zusätzliche Felder variieren je nach Plugin** (z. B. API-URL, Anmeldedaten, Zonenfilter)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:44
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Klicken Sie auf :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:46
msgid ""
"|morpheus| validates the connection and synchronizes available DNS zones "
"from the provider."
msgstr "|morpheus| validiert die Verbindung und synchronisiert verfügbare DNS-Zonen vom Provider."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:49
msgid "Using Plugin DNS with Provisioning"
msgstr "Plugin-DNS mit Provisionierung verwenden"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:51
msgid ""
"Once configured, plugin DNS providers integrate with the provisioning "
"workflow:"
msgstr "Nach der Konfiguration integrieren sich Plugin-DNS-Provider in den Provisionierungs-Workflow:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:53
msgid "Associate the DNS integration with a Cloud or Network Domain"
msgstr "Ordnen Sie die DNS-Integration einer Cloud- oder Netzwerk-Domain zu"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:54
msgid "Configure naming policies that include DNS domain suffixes"
msgstr "Konfigurieren Sie Naming-Policies, die DNS-Domain-Suffixe enthalten"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:55
msgid "During provisioning, |morpheus| automatically:"
msgstr "Während der Provisionierung führt |morpheus| automatisch Folgendes aus:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:57
msgid "Creates A/AAAA records for the provisioned Instance"
msgstr "Erstellt A/AAAA-Records für die provisionierte Instanz"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:58
msgid "Creates PTR records if reverse zones are configured"
msgstr "Erstellt PTR-Records, wenn Reverse-Zonen konfiguriert sind"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:59
msgid "Applies hostname based on naming policies"
msgstr "Wendet den Hostnamen basierend auf Naming-Policies an"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:61
msgid "During Instance teardown, DNS records are automatically removed"
msgstr "Beim Tear-down der Instanz werden DNS-Records automatisch entfernt"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:64
msgid "Managing Records"
msgstr "Records verwalten"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:66
msgid ""
"DNS records managed through plugin providers are accessible in the "
"standard Domains interface:"
msgstr "Über Plugin-Provider verwaltete DNS-Records sind in der Standard-Domains-Oberfläche zugänglich:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:68
msgid "Navigate to Infrastructure > Network > Domains"
msgstr "Navigieren Sie zu Infrastructure > Network > Domains"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:69
msgid "Select the domain associated with the plugin DNS provider"
msgstr "Wählen Sie die dem Plugin-DNS-Provider zugeordnete Domain"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:70
msgid "View, add, edit, or delete records as with any DNS integration"
msgstr "Records anzeigen, hinzufügen, bearbeiten oder löschen wie bei jeder DNS-Integration"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:72
msgid ""
"Supported record types depend on the specific plugin implementation. "
"Common types include:"
msgstr "Unterstützte Record-Typen hängen von der spezifischen Plugin-Implementierung ab. Häufige Typen sind:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:74
msgid "**A:** IPv4 address records"
msgstr "**A:** IPv4-Adress-Records"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:75
msgid "**AAAA:** IPv6 address records"
msgstr "**AAAA:** IPv6-Adress-Records"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:76
msgid "**CNAME:** Canonical name aliases"
msgstr "**CNAME:** Canonical-Name-Aliase"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:77
msgid "**TXT:** Text records"
msgstr "**TXT:** Text-Records"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:78
msgid "**MX:** Mail exchange records"
msgstr "**MX:** Mail-Exchange-Records"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:79
msgid "**PTR:** Pointer (reverse DNS) records"
msgstr "**PTR:** Pointer-Records (Reverse-DNS)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:80
msgid "**SRV:** Service locator records"
msgstr "**SRV:** Service-Locator-Records"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:83
msgid "Developing DNS Plugins"
msgstr "DNS-Plugins entwickeln"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:85
msgid ""
"DNS plugins are developed using the |morpheus| Plugin API. A DNS plugin "
"must:"
msgstr "DNS-Plugins werden mit der |morpheus| Plugin API entwickelt. Ein DNS-Plugin muss:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:87
msgid "Extend the appropriate base class (``DnsProvider``)"
msgstr "Die entsprechende Basisklasse erweitern (``DnsProvider``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:88
msgid "Implement zone listing and record management methods"
msgstr "Methoden zur Zonenauflistung und Record-Verwaltung implementieren"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:89
msgid "Package as a JAR file with a plugin descriptor"
msgstr "Als JAR-Datei mit Plugin-Deskriptor paketieren"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:90
msgid "Register provider types and option types for configuration"
msgstr "Provider-Typen und Optionstypen für die Konfiguration registrieren"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:92
msgid ""
"For plugin development details, refer to the `Morpheus Plugin Developer "
"Guide <https://developer.morpheusdata.com>`_."
msgstr "Details zur Plugin-Entwicklung finden Sie im `Morpheus Plugin Developer Guide <https://developer.morpheusdata.com>`_."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:94
msgid "Example plugin structure:"
msgstr "Beispiel für die Plugin-Struktur:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/plugin_dns.rst:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"class MyDnsProvider extends DnsProvider {\n"
"    // Zone operations\n"
"    ServiceResponse listZones(Map opts)\n"
"    ServiceResponse createZone(Map zoneConfig)\n"
"    ServiceResponse deleteZone(Map zoneConfig)\n"
"\n"
"    // Record operations\n"
"    ServiceResponse listRecords(String zone, Map opts)\n"
"    ServiceResponse createRecord(String zone, Map recordConfig)\n"
"    ServiceResponse updateRecord(String zone, Map recordConfig)\n"
"    ServiceResponse deleteRecord(String zone, Map recordConfig)\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

